  BigEdit is a plain AppKit app distributed with Developer ID (not sandboxed),
  so the hardened runtime needs no exception entitlements. This file is kept
  empty on purpose; add keys here only if a future feature requires a specific
  hardened-runtime exception (e.g. JIT, library validation).
-->
